### BUG #1: $NaN nos Õndices de Mercado (OMNIPRESENTE)

**Severidade:** P0 CRÕTICO - DestruiÁ„o total de credibilidade
**Impacto:** 100% das p·ginas afetadas (DOW, S&P 500, NASDAQ)
**Estimativa:** 2-4 horas

**Root Cause (Identificado por Codex):**
```typescript
// L PROBLEMA: client/src/components/layout/top-bar.tsx:47-49
const formatIndexValue = (value: number) => {
  const converted = convertCurrency(value, marketCurrency, userCurrency);
  //  convertCurrency() È ASSÕNCRONO mas usado SEM await!
  // converted È Promise<number>, n„o number!
  return formatCurrency(converted); // L formatCurrency recebe Promise í $NaN
};
```

**Fix Detalhado:**

```typescript
//  SOLU«√O: State-based conversion com useEffect
const [convertedIndices, setConvertedIndices] = useState({
  dow: null as number | null,
  sp: null as number | null,
  nasdaq: null as number | null,
});

useEffect(() => {
  const convertAll = async () => {
    try {
      const [dow, sp, nasdaq] = await Promise.all([
        convertCurrency(dowValue ?? 0, marketCurrency, userCurrency),
        convertCurrency(spValue ?? 0, marketCurrency, userCurrency),
        convertCurrency(nasdaqValue ?? 0, marketCurrency, userCurrency),
      ]);
      setConvertedIndices({ dow, sp, nasdaq });
    } catch (error) {
      console.error('Currency conversion failed:', error);
      // Fallback para valores originais
      setConvertedIndices({
        dow: dowValue ?? 0,
        sp: spValue ?? 0,
        nasdaq: nasdaqValue ?? 0
      });
    }
  };

  if (dowValue && spValue && nasdaqValue) {
    convertAll();
  }
}, [dowValue, spValue, nasdaqValue, marketCurrency, userCurrency]);

// Uso:
<div className="text-sm">
  {convertedIndices.dow !== null
    ? formatCurrency(convertedIndices.dow)
    : ''}
</div>
```

**InstruÁıes de ImplementaÁ„o:**

1. **Local Development:**
   ```bash
   cd "/Users/antoniofrancisco/Documents/teste 1"

   # 1. Editar ficheiro
   # client/src/components/layout/top-bar.tsx

   # 2. Testar localmente
   npm run dev
   # Verificar: http://localhost:3000 - Ìndices devem mostrar valores corretos

   # 3. Build de teste
   npm run build
   ```

2. **Testes a Validar:**
   - [ ] Õndices mostram valores numÈricos (n„o $NaN)
   - [ ] Convers„o EUR/USD funciona corretamente
   - [ ] Fallback para "" se API falhar
   - [ ] Loading state durante convers„o
   - [ ] Console sem erros

3. **Deploy para ProduÁ„o (Hetzner):**
   ```bash
   # Deploy frontend
   npm run deploy

   # SSH para validar
   ssh root@128.140.45.28
   cd "/home/teste 1"
   pm2 logs alfalyzer --lines 20

   # Verificar: https://128.140.45.28.sslip.io/
   # Confirmar Ìndices sem $NaN em TODAS as p·ginas
   ```

4. **ValidaÁ„o PÛs-Deploy:**
   - [ ] Homepage: Ìndices corretos
   - [ ] /stock/AAPL: Ìndices corretos
